inganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1546755/1dafbfca-5691-4d4c-a5b7-597c51b99e1c.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1546755/1dafbfca-5691-4d4c-a5b7-597c51b99e1c.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Spacious studio maisonette apartment near the water, with gallery, balcony and magnificent view over the roofs of Strausberg city center. Incl. free parking space in the inner courtyard, fresh laundry, high-speed internet, for everyone who works remotely\n\nThe 80 sqm, two-story apartment has an open bedroom with a unique 200 x 200 cm comfortable bed with a EMMA One mattress (medium) as well as another sleeping option - coming soon - in the living room. Allergy pillowcases are possible if advised.\n\nRight next to the sleeping area there is a relaxing bathroom with a bathtub where fresh towels are ready for you.\n\nBoth levels of the maisonette apartment, which impresses with characterful parquet floors, floor-to-ceiling windows, a gallery and a large balcony, are connected via a wooden staircase that sometimes creaks a bit.\n\nIn the lower area there is a stylish living/dining area with a 1.60 m large real wood table, which is ideal for sitting together or working; as well as a kitchen with a Nespresso coffee machine, free capsules and tea and basic equipment for all cooking fans.\n\nIn the living room there is a sofa bed and a BenQ projector with Google Chromecast including numerous app media libraries and Bluetooth speakers from harman/kardon for an atmospheric film experience; Simply switch it on and stream your series, films or videos.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"no"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"no"},"bedroomSize":{"value":"35"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"tenantStatus":{"value":"working professionals only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"80"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"no"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":298000,"deposit":298000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"2980.00","deposit":"2980.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":1,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":18,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-05-04"}],"updated":"2026-05-04T15:51:13Z","__utId__":"ut1546755"}]